  "id": "black-sesame-yuzu-trifle",
  "name": "Black Sesame Yuzu Trifle",
  "subtitle": "Sesame sponge, citrus curd, cream, and crisp sugar shards",
  "description": "Layer sesame sponge with yuzu curd, black sesame cream, and dalgona brittle for a lightly bitter, citrusy dessert.",
